<title>USA: Howard Cty, Ind., agency deal ylds 5.4 pct in 2007.</title>
<headline>Howard Cty, Ind., agency deal ylds 5.4 pct in 2007.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
